.el .ds Aq '
.TH elfshaker-show 1  "elfshaker 1.0.0-rc1" "elfshaker Manual"
.SH NAME
elfshaker\-show \- Shows the contents of the files in the snapshot.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBelfshaker show\fR [\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-\-data\-dir\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsnapshot\fR> <\fIpath\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Shows the contents of the files in the snapshot.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-verbose\fR
Enables verbose description of the execution process.
.TP
\fB\-\-data\-dir\fR [default: elfshaker_data]
Set the path to the elfshaker repository.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIsnapshot\fR>
The snapshot in which to to look for the files.
.TP
<\fIpath\fR>
Specifies the path(s) to show.
